WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.158
Reseller administrators start in the customer directory.

2
00:00:03.158 --> 00:00:09.475
Open a customer workspace to work inside that tenant scope, then choose Customer Fleet.

3
00:00:09.475 --> 00:00:16.243
Delegated fleet management allows the reseller to add a vehicle and select its map appearance.

4
00:00:16.243 --> 00:00:22.560
Location access does not come with fleet management; customers still control every location grant.
